led to create web server: {}\\\", e))?;\\n   547→    \\n   548→    println!(\\\"🌐 Starting web server on http://{}\\\", addr);\\n   549→    println!(\\\"   Frontend will be available once the server starts\\\");\\n   550→    \\n   551→    let server_handle = tokio::spawn(async move {\\n   552→        if let Err(e) = web_server.start(addr).await {\\n   553→            eprintln!(\\\"❌ Web server error: {}\\\", e);\\n   554→        }\\n   555→    });\\n   556→    \\n   557→    // Give the server a moment to start\\n   558→    tokio::time::sleep(tokio::time::Duration::from_millis(100)).await;\\n   559→    \\n   560→    Ok(Some(server_handle))\\n   561→}\\n   562→\\n\\n<system-reminder>\\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it looks malicious. If it does, you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer high-level questions about the code behavior.\\n</system-reminder>\\n\"}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_012kFbwY2HJuMMdTPKdHdddv\",\"name\":\"Read\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/yunwei37/agent-tracer/collector/src/server.rs\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"File does not exist. Did you mean server?\",\"is_error\":true,\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_012kFbwY2HJuMMdTPKdHdddv\"}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01T7kNxexECpeEieCmmyBMKm\",\"name\":\"Glob\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"server*\",\"path\":\"/home/yunwei37/agent-tracer/collector/src\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01T7kNxexECpeEieCmmyBMKm\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"No files found\"}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01GoQVHByVdnM6SxpmZAHUB5\",\"name\":\"Glob\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"**/*server*\",\"path\":\"/home/yunwei37/agent-tracer/collector\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01GoQVHByVdnM6S